msgctxt "116"
msgid "Baseball!? What in the world were you thinking!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Do you hear me, young man!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"My Akira-chan is a fragile boy! He can't be playing sports\r\n"
"with you ruffians!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "What happened, Koji?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Well, um... Akira-kun tripped and hit his head when he was\r\n"
"running after a fly ball."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"Running!? Does my Akira-chan look like the kind of boy who\r\n"
"runs!? How dare you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"I don't see why not. Does he have some kind of health condition that keeps "
"him from exercising?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"Well no, but baseball is absurdly dangerous! I can't believe\r\n"
"you would let your children play it unsupervised!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"How dangerous can it be with a rubber ball and a plastic\r\n"
"bat? Besides, it's totally normal for kids their age to be\r\n"
"playing sports on their own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "...It's okay, Uncle Kaz. This was all my fault. I made Akira-kun do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Hello? What's going on in here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"Oh, Miyamura-san! I rushed over as soon as I heard what\r\n"
"happened to your son. I'm terribly sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"Sorry isn't good enough, Hashimoto-sensei! Just what are you\r\n"
"teaching these children, hm!? The school board is going to\r\n"
"hear about this, I can promise you that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "The school has nothing to do with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"*sigh* Why is it that you always seem to be at the center\r\n"
"of my problems, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "What was that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "Wait. You know this brute, Hashimoto-sensei!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid ""
"Not exactly. He runs this orphanage, though. These\r\n"
"foul-tempered orphans of his caused quite the trouble for\r\n"
"my son recently."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"What!? Then is it possible they forced my poor, sweet\r\n"
"Akira-chan to play that horrible game with them!? I simply\r\n"
"cannot stand for this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"Well? What do you have to say for yourself, young man?\r\n"
"This silly game was just an excuse to bully my innocent boy,\r\n"
"wasn't it!? Tell me the truth!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Koji's no bully."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "How am I supposed to believe that after what happened to my Akira-chan!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "Police! I want the police here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "Yes, ma'am! I'll call them right away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "Ungh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "Don't worry, Akira-chan! The nice cops will be here soon!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "K-Koji-kun..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "Akira-kun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "I'm so sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid ""
"You guys let me play with you, then I had to go and mess it\r\n"
"all up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "It was... fun, though. Baseball."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "Maybe we can play again sometime? Once I get better."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "Of course!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid ""
"Baseball, Akira-chan? What are you saying!? You must have\r\n"
"hit your head even harder than you realized!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid ""
"And don't get any ideas about seeing these awful orphans\r\n"
"again! I'm forbidding you from ever coming back here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid ""
"They're not awful, mom. And they didn't pressure me into\r\n"
"playing with them. I wanted to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid ""
"Koji-kun and Taichi-kun are really nice. Way nicer than\r\n"
"the other kids in my class. So don't be mean to them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "But Akira-chan!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid ""
"No, mom. Everyone here gets along so well. Nobody'd ever\r\n"
"bully me... Not like at school."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "What!? You're being bullied at school!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid "...Sometimes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "By who!? Tell me his name!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "Akira-kun, he...!"
msgstr ""

